OL,3,APutin warns West that Russia is ready
OL,4,Ato use every weapon to protect
OL,5,AKaliningrad
OL,6,
OL,7,FVladimir Putin has said Russia will use
OL,8,Fall weapons at his disposal if it
OL,9,Fconsiders it has come under direct
OL,10,Fattack in its Baltic exclave of
OL,11,FKaliningrad.
OL,13,FAddressing the Valdai foreign policy
OL,14,Fforum, Putin insisted Russia was "not
OL,15,Fthreatening anyone" and merely
OL,16,Fresponding to statements by Western
OL,17,Fleaders that Moscow was preparing for
OL,18,Fwar in 2029 or 2030.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
